        instruction = "A workbook written by Iru-Kuiru. \"That place was most definitely cursed. It was as if each of us were having our strings pulled by some unseen force...\" \"The Goddess only knows what that power was. I knew fear like I had never known before, and was struck mindless with panic before the terror that lurked within these walls.\"",
