        depth = 3,
        instruction = "A diary written by Iru-Kuiru. \"A letter has arrived from the homeland. The San d'Orian member of the Allied Expedition, Francmage M Mistalle, has lost his life to the curse...\" \"And then yesterday, my friend and fellow Allied explorer, Yow Rabntah, was taken from this world...\" \"I can feel the shadow closing in on me. I believe the darkness will claim me before I am able to finish this research. And I was so...",
